  {
   "id": "girls-of-the-tower-279532@major-2024-09-02",
   "gameId": "girls-of-the-tower-279532",
   "displayName": "Update Announcement September 2, 2024",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-02T03:09:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Bond Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Wild Heart: Wild Heart minions gain a 30% damage increase when at full health and regenerate 10% of their energy per second.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Flame of Destruction: When a Flame of Destruction minion dies, it adds one layer of Ashes to other Flame of Destruction minions. When Ashes exceed 6 layers, the minion gains a Destruction effect, with its maximum energy increased to 10 for 6 seconds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whisper of the Wind: Critical hits apply a Silence effect to the target.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Holy Prayer: When a Holy Prayer minion dies, it no longer heals other Holy Prayer minions. Instead, it grants invincibility to all remaining Holy Prayer minions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Arrow Rain: Arrow Rain no longer increases damage. Instead, each attack applies a See-through effect to the target. When the target reaches 50 stacks of See-through, it loses all physical and magical defense.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Future Updates: Changes will be made to Empire, War Frenzy, and other similar skills.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Minion Rework",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Heavy-armored Little John: Passive: When health is above 50%, gains Heroism, increasing attack power by 35%. When health is below 50%, gains Fearless, increasing damage reduction by 25%.: Active: Applies one stack of Bounty to all enemies. If in Heroism state, deals X fire magic damage to the target. If in Fearless state, restores X health.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Archer Hundington: Passive: Every 5th basic attack applies one stack of Bounty to the target. When attacking a target with Bounty, each stack grants 1 Silver Coin and removes the Bounty, granting one stack of Renown, increasing attack by 1%.: Active: Fires a Pursuing Arrow at the target, dealing X fire magic damage and applying 4 stacks of Bounty. Fires an additional arrow for every 3 stacks of Renown.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nightmare: Passive: Attacks apply a Fear Mark to the target. When the Fear Mark reaches 10 stacks, it deals true fire damage and stuns for 1.5 seconds.: Active: Releases a Fear Fireball to all enemies, dealing fire magic damage and applying 5 stacks of Fear Mark. Nightmare can attack all enemies for the next 3 seconds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Two-headed Serpent Dragon: Passive: Basic attacks hit 2 enemies and steal 1% of their maximum health per hit.: Active: Deals true damage based on the target's maximum health to two enemies. If the Two-headed Serpent Dragon's health is above 5000, it enters a berserk state, gaining 50% attack speed, 30% attack power, and skill intensity.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tyamat: Passive: Gains 15% magic penetration for each enemy killed.: Active: Deals lightning magic damage to all enemies. If an enemy is killed by this skill, it will be cast again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sariel: Passive: Increases the skill intensity of the nearest allied units.: Alternate Active: (1) Fires Divine Punishment Spears at all enemies, dealing poison magic damage and reducing attack and skill intensity by 30% for 10 seconds. (2) Restores health to all allies and increases their attack and skill intensity by 30%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Future Changes: Further modifications will be made to Nekomata, Takemikazuchi, Light Elf, Guardian Archangel, Soul of the North, Bhuj, and others.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
